<h1>
  Title
</h1>
<p>
  My page
</p>
<%- include('footer'); -%>
```

此外，include() 也可以傳入參數：

```htmlmixed=
<ul>
  <% users.forEach(function(user){ %>
    <%- include('user/show', {user: user}); %>
  <% }); %>
</ul>
```

